{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q423046","formula":"CClF₃","hill":"CClF3","elements":["C","F","Cl"],"composition":{"C":1.0,"F":3.0,"Cl":1.0},"names":{"en":"Chlorotrifluoromethane","ru":"Трифторхлорметан"},"descriptions":{"en":"Chlorotrifluoromethane, R-13, CFC-13, or Freon 13, is a non-flammable, non-corrosive, nontoxic chlorofluorocarbon (CFC) and also a mixed halomethane. It is a man-made substance used primarily as a refrigerant. When released into the environment, CFC-13 has a high ozone depletion potential, and long atmospheric lifetime.","ru":"Трифторхлормета́н (R-13, хлортрифтормета́н, перфторметилхлори́д, трифторметилхлори́д) — химическое соединение из класса хлорфторуглеродов с химической формулой CClF3. Это бесцветный газ без запаха, он не горюч и не токсичен. Использовался как хладагент, однако обладает высоким потенциалом разрушения озонового слоя и большой длительностью нахождения в атмосфере."},"fame":25,"pubchemCid":6392,"mass":104.46,"charge":0,"smiles":"C(F)(F)(F)Cl","inchikey":"AFYPFACVUDMOHA-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"chloro(trifluoro)methane","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"6392","atoms":5,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-1.697,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"el":"Cl"},{"x":0.547,"y":-0.809,"z":-0.967,"el":"F"},{"x":0.547,"y":1.242,"z":-0.217,"el":"F"},{"x":0.547,"y":-0.433,"z":1.184,"el":"F"},{"x":0.057,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"el":"C"}],"bonds":[[0,4,1],[1,4,1],[2,4,1],[3,4,1]]},"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q423046","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chlorotrifluoromethane","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A2%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%85%D0%BB